---
import { ArrowLeft } from '@lucide/astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="页面未找到" pageType="page">
  <section class="content-surface not-found">
    <p class="error-code" aria-label="错误代码 404">404</p>
    <h1>这条小路，还没有通往哪里。</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">页面可能已移动，也可能是地址写错了。回到首页，或者搜索一篇文章。</p>
    <div class="not-found-actions"><a class="contact-link" href={url('/')}><ArrowLeft size={17} aria-hidden="true" />回到首页</a><button class="text-button" type="button" data-open-search>搜索文章</button></div>
  </section>
</Base>
